--- .gitignore (原始)
# Miscellaneous
*.class
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
.DS_Store
.atom/
.build/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
.swiftpm/
migrate_working_dir/

# IntelliJ related
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/

# The .vscode folder contains launch configuration and tasks you configure in
# VS Code which you may wish to be included in version control, so this line
# is commented out by default.
#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/


+++ .gitignore (修改后)
```
# Dependencies
.dart_tool/
.packages

# Build outputs
build/
*.apk
*.aab
*.app

# Logs
*.log

# Environment
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Coverage
coverage/
*.coverage

# Distribution
dist/
target/

# Python artifacts (if any Python files exist in project)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Node artifacts (if any JS/TS files exist in project)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
```